{"end_line": 391, "heading": "Is any information missing from individual instances? If so, please provide a description, explaining why this information is missing (e.g., because it was unavailable). This does not include intentionally removed information, but might include, e.g., redacted text.", "kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/arxiv-2406.13805--21c7c163/source/main.tex", "selector": "arxiv://2406.13805@sha256-52bd597205247954/main.tex#L391", "start_line": 391}
