{"end_line": 397, "heading": "Are there recommended data splits (e.g., training, development/validation,testing)? If so, please provide a description of these splits, explaining the rationale behind them.", "kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/arxiv-2406.13805--21c7c163/source/main.tex", "selector": "arxiv://2406.13805@sha256-52bd597205247954/main.tex#L397", "start_line": 397}
