{"end_line": 408, "heading": "Does the dataset contain data that might be considered confidential (e.g., data that is protected by legal privilege or by doctor-patient confidentiality, data that includes the content of individuals’ non-public communications)?If so, please provide a description.", "kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/arxiv-2406.13805--21c7c163/source/main.tex", "selector": "arxiv://2406.13805@sha256-52bd597205247954/main.tex#L408", "start_line": 408}
