{"end_line": 454, "heading": "Did the individuals in question consent to the collection and use of their data? If so, please describe (or show with screenshots or other information) how consent was requested and provided, and provide a link or other access point to, or otherwise reproduce, the exact language to which the individuals consented.", "kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/arxiv-2406.13805--21c7c163/source/main.tex", "selector": "arxiv://2406.13805@sha256-52bd597205247954/main.tex#L454", "start_line": 454}
